        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1) subseksyen yang berikut: “(1A) The certificate referred to in subsection (1) may be issued to any Commissioner of Police or Director of Immigration through an electronic medium or by way of electronic transmission.”. Pindaan seksyen 106"
      }
