      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_II__cl_27__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_II__cl_27__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Jadual 1 kepada Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_II__cl_27__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_II__cl_27",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam Bahagian I, dalam perenggan 1, dalam ruang Rate of income tax, dengan menggantikan perkataan “14 per cent” dengan perkataan “13 per cent” yang terdapat di baris kelima; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_II__cl_27__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_II__cl_27",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas Bahagian XVI bahagian yang berikut: “PArt XVII 1. Notwithstanding Part I, income tax shall be charged for a specified year of assessment on the chargeable income of a person who carries on business in respect of a qualifying activity under an incentive scheme approved by the Minister at the rate of not more than 20 per cent on every ringgit of that chargeable income. 2. In this Part, the applicable rate, the specified year of assessment and the conditions of the incentive scheme shall be as prescribed by the Minister. PArt XVIII 1. Notwithstanding Parts I and II, income tax shall be charged for a specified year of assessment on the chargeable income of an individual resident who is not a citizen having and exercising employment in a company which carries on business in respect of a qualifying activity under an incentive scheme approved by the Minister at the rate of not more than 20 per cent on every ringgit of that chargeable income. 2. In this Part, the applicable rate, the specified year of assessment and the conditions of the incentive scheme shall be as prescribed by the Minister.”. Pindaan Jadual 3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_II__cl_28",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "28",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_II__cl_28__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_II__cl_28__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Jadual 3 kepada Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_II__cl_28__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_II__cl_28",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan 70 perenggan yang berikut: “70a. In this Schedule, “plant” means an apparatus used by a person for carrying on his business but does not include a building, an intangible asset, or any asset used and that functions as a place within which a business is carried on.”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_II__cl_28__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_II__cl_28",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subsubsubperenggan 75 b(1)(a)(ii), dengan memotong perkataan “nominal”. Pindaan Jadual 6"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_II__cl_29",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "29",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Jadual 6 kepada Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan proviso kepada subsubperenggan 15(1)(b) dengan proviso yang berikut: “Provided that— (a) this subsubparagraph shall apply to the payment made in respect of an individual who has ceased employment on or after 1 July 2008; and (b) a further sum of ten thousand ringgit is allowed to be multiplied by the number of completed years of service in respect of an individual who has ceased employment on or after 1 January 2020 but not later than 31 December 2021.”. Pindaan Jadual 7a"
      }
    },
