      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 80A seksyen yang berikut: “Power of Collector to remit duties 80b. The duty paid or payable by any person may be remitted wholly or in part on grounds of poverty by the Collector and, where the sum remitted has been paid, the Collector shall repay the same.”. Pindaan seksyen 82"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_50",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "50",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 82 Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan (aa) perenggan yang berikut: “(ab) to prescribe the means of digital stamping to be used under this Act for the payment of stamp duty, to provide for matters relating to the issuance and validity of the digital stamping;”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_I__cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ini bolehlah dinamakan Akta Kewangan 2020. Pindaan Akta"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_I__cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/17/msa@/~chp_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967 [Akta 53], Akta Cukai Keuntungan Harta Tanah 1976 [Akta 169], Akta Setem 1949 [Akta 378], Akta Petroleum (Cukai Pendapatan) 1967 [Akta 543], Akta Cukai Aktiviti Perniagaan Labuan 1990 [Akta 445], Akta Kewangan 2012 [Akta 742] dan Akta Kewangan 2018 [Akta 812] dipinda mengikut cara yang dinyatakan masing-masing dalam Bab II, III, IV, V, VI, VII dan VIII."
      }
    },
    {
